openvswitch-switch-doca
-------------------------

This package provides a DOCA-enabled Open vSwitch vswitchd binary linked
statically against DPDK and DOCA. By default, the ovs-vswitchd binary from
openvswitch-switch is used (see update-alternatives --query ovs-vswitchd).

To select this binary:

   sudo update-alternatives --set ovs-vswitchd \
        /usr/lib/openvswitch-switch-doca/ovs-vswitchd-doca
   sudo service openvswitch-switch restart

Configure DOCA via ovsdb.  All of the following are required: enable DPDK
(`other_config:dpdk-init=true`), enable DOCA (`other_config:doca-init=true`),
and set `other_config:dpdk-extra` to a dummy PCI allow-list (for example
`-a pci:0000:00:00.0`) so DPDK does not auto-probe NICs managed by DOCA.
See Documentation/howto/doca.rst and the NVIDIA DOCA documentation.

 -- Open vSwitch team <dev@openvswitch.org>
